WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.634 --> 00:00:04.000
Welcome, welcome, welcome to
"The Tonight Show," everybody.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:07.267
[ Cheers and applause ]
You're here.

00:00:07.267 --> 00:00:09.400
It seems like there's
so much going on right now.

00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:12.167
Prince Harry's new book
came out today.

00:00:12.167 --> 00:00:16.300
The horror movie "M3GAN"
is a hit at the box office.

00:00:16.300 --> 00:00:20.601
Tonight's Mega Millions jackpot
was over $1.1 billion.

00:00:20.601 --> 00:00:22.567
And Papa John's just unveiled

00:00:22.567 --> 00:00:25.767
these new doughy snack balls
called Papa Bites.

00:00:25.767 --> 00:00:26.968
[ Laughter ]

00:00:26.968 --> 00:00:29.100
There's a lot to go over,
so let's just jump in

00:00:29.100 --> 00:00:32.100
and cover it all at once.
It's time for a "News Smash."

00:00:32.100 --> 00:00:37.067
♪♪

00:00:37.067 --> 00:00:38.567
First up, Prince Harry.

00:00:38.567 --> 00:00:41.167
Today, his new book called
"SPARE" hit shelves,

00:00:41.167 --> 00:00:43.901
and it's full of details about
his life, his relationships,

00:00:43.901 --> 00:00:45.767
and his exit
from the royal family.

00:00:45.767 --> 00:00:48.434
Long story short, everything
changed when he married...

00:00:48.434 --> 00:00:49.701
"M3GAN."

00:00:49.701 --> 00:00:50.868
The --

00:00:50.868 --> 00:00:52.400
[ Laughter ]

00:00:55.234 --> 00:00:58.267
The horror movie is doing great
at the box office,

00:00:58.267 --> 00:01:00.567
bringing in over $30 million.

00:01:00.567 --> 00:01:01.934
It's made so much money,

00:01:01.934 --> 00:01:03.267
the producers feel like
they won...

00:01:03.267 --> 00:01:05.501
the lottery.

00:01:05.501 --> 00:01:07.000
Tonight's Mega Millions jackpot

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:10.601
was one of the biggest
of all time, over $1.1 billion.

00:01:10.601 --> 00:01:11.801
Wow. That's a lot of...

00:01:11.801 --> 00:01:13.534
dough.

00:01:13.534 --> 00:01:15.601
Papa John's uses it
to make their new snack

00:01:15.601 --> 00:01:16.901
called Papa Bites,

00:01:16.901 --> 00:01:19.033
but don't eat too many --
you only have one heart.

00:01:19.033 --> 00:01:21.701
You don't have a..."SPARE."

00:01:21.701 --> 00:01:24.267
The book talks about
how Harry didn't get along

00:01:24.267 --> 00:01:26.534
with his brother,
his stepmother, or his...

00:01:26.534 --> 00:01:28.701
Papa.

00:01:28.701 --> 00:01:31.033
Seriously, don't overdo it
on those little bites.

00:01:31.033 --> 00:01:32.868
They're so high in calories,
they could....

00:01:32.868 --> 00:01:34.934
kill you.

00:01:34.934 --> 00:01:37.701
"M3GAN" is a terrifying doll,
kinda like Annabelle

00:01:37.701 --> 00:01:39.167
or even Chucky, the...

00:01:39.167 --> 00:01:41.634
redhead.

00:01:41.634 --> 00:01:43.567
Harry didn't have just
one reason to leave England.

00:01:43.567 --> 00:01:45.434
It was more like...a billion.

00:01:45.434 --> 00:01:48.167
And that's -- that's enough
money to live like a...

00:01:48.167 --> 00:01:49.501
prince.

00:01:49.501 --> 00:01:51.701
Harry is speaking out against
his powerful family.

00:01:51.701 --> 00:01:53.234
And you've got to admit,
that takes...

00:01:53.234 --> 00:01:54.634
balls.

00:01:54.634 --> 00:01:57.300
These treats might be
too much for some people,

00:01:57.300 --> 00:01:59.467
but stoners are
looking at them like...

00:01:59.467 --> 00:02:01.300
jackpot!

00:02:01.300 --> 00:02:02.334
In conclusion...

00:02:02.334 --> 00:02:03.868
so much to tell...

00:02:03.868 --> 00:02:05.334
Will it sell?

00:02:05.334 --> 00:02:06.767
What's that smell?

00:02:06.767 --> 00:02:08.501
Run like hell.

00:02:08.501 --> 00:02:10.434
This has been a "News Smash."

00:02:10.434 --> 00:02:14.901
♪♪

00:02:14.901 --> 00:02:17.567
Oh, my goodness.

00:02:17.567 --> 00:02:20.300
Thank you, everybody.
Everyone is talking about this.

00:02:20.300 --> 00:02:21.701
President Biden's lawyers

00:02:21.701 --> 00:02:23.701
were cleaning out
one of his old offices

00:02:23.701 --> 00:02:25.267
from before he was president.

00:02:25.267 --> 00:02:26.667
And you're not gonna
believe this,

00:02:26.667 --> 00:02:30.100
but they found that Biden
had 10 classified documents.

00:02:30.100 --> 00:02:31.868
[ Audience oohs ]

00:02:31.868 --> 00:02:35.234
The documents found were from
Biden's time as vice president.

00:02:35.234 --> 00:02:37.200
Today, Obama was like,
"Nothing to worry about.

00:02:37.200 --> 00:02:39.667
If Joe had access,
it wasn't important.

00:02:39.667 --> 00:02:41.667
[ Laughter ]

00:02:41.667 --> 00:02:43.467
Don't worry about it."

00:02:43.467 --> 00:02:45.400
Yep, Biden was shocked and said

00:02:45.400 --> 00:02:47.567
he had no idea
how the documents got there.

00:02:47.567 --> 00:02:52.167
Then Hunter Biden was like,
"Okay, so don't get mad..."

00:02:52.167 --> 00:02:53.667
[ Laughter ]

00:02:53.667 --> 00:02:55.400
Of course,
former President Trump

00:02:55.400 --> 00:02:57.067
wasted no time weighing in.

00:02:57.067 --> 00:02:59.334
He got on his social-media
platform and posted,

00:02:59.334 --> 00:03:02.701
"When is the FBI going to raid
the many homes of Joe Biden,

00:03:02.701 --> 00:03:05.067
perhaps even the White House?"

00:03:05.067 --> 00:03:06.501
Good point.

00:03:06.501 --> 00:03:09.267
It -- It would be suspicious
if classified documents

00:03:09.267 --> 00:03:11.033
were found at the White House.

00:03:11.033 --> 00:03:13.467
[ Laughter ]

00:03:13.467 --> 00:03:15.634
Speaking of the White House,
the Biden administration

00:03:15.634 --> 00:03:18.868
is considering a nationwide ban
on gas stoves,

00:03:18.868 --> 00:03:21.234
which has been linked
to health problems.

00:03:21.234 --> 00:03:22.868
Today, Americans were like,

00:03:22.868 --> 00:03:25.734
"Better play it safe and order
a Baconator from Door Dash."

00:03:25.734 --> 00:03:28.334
[ Laughter ]

00:03:28.334 --> 00:03:30.968
Yep, gas stoves
could be banned soon.

00:03:30.968 --> 00:03:33.567
The best way to heat something
up will be to open three apps

00:03:33.567 --> 00:03:36.067
on your iPhone at once
then use it as a hot plate.

00:03:36.067 --> 00:03:38.734
Tssss!
Get that sear you want.

00:03:38.734 --> 00:03:40.934
That's right --
gas stoves are a problem,

00:03:40.934 --> 00:03:43.367
but somehow deep-frying a turkey
is still perfectly legal.

00:03:43.367 --> 00:03:46.634
I don't know.
And on your back porch, no less.

00:03:46.634 --> 00:03:48.501
Guys, the horror movie "M3GAN"

00:03:48.501 --> 00:03:50.300
is the biggest new movie
out in theaters.

00:03:50.300 --> 00:03:51.634
In fact, it's such a huge hit,

00:03:51.634 --> 00:03:53.701
they're already
working on a sequel.

00:03:53.701 --> 00:03:55.934
Yeah. Take a look
at the trailer I just saw.

00:03:55.934 --> 00:03:58.200
-The surprise hit of the year
is "M3GAN."

00:03:58.200 --> 00:04:01.634
And coming next year, be sure to
catch the heart-stopping sequel,

00:04:01.634 --> 00:04:03.767
"M2GAN" -- or "M3GAN 2."

00:04:03.767 --> 00:04:05.133
Or is it "M23GAN"?

00:04:05.133 --> 00:04:08.367
"M32-GAN." "M2G3N."
"2GM3N."

00:04:08.367 --> 00:04:11.767
Eh, screw it!
Go see "Murder Doll 2."

00:04:11.767 --> 00:04:12.767
COM1N9...

00:04:12.767 --> 00:04:14.300
Oh, come on!

00:04:14.300 --> 00:04:15.701
-Interesting.

00:04:15.701 --> 00:04:18.667
[ Applause ]

00:04:18.667 --> 00:04:21.734
Well, switching gears,
I read that Babies "R" Us,

00:04:21.734 --> 00:04:23.767
